Small talk in French = talk about the weather ☁️🇫🇷

• quel temps fait-il ? = what's the weather like?
• il fait froid = it's cold
• il y a du vent = it's windy
• un nuage = a cloud
• il va neiger = it's going to snow

💌 Save this for your next small talk
👯 Send it to a friend in a different time zone

